   <div class="eyebrow">Concealed Centre Hung Design</div>
   <h2 class="heading">How the Centre Hung <em>Door Arrangement Works</em></h2>
   <p class="copy">
    The Centre Hung configuration conceals the OA100 operator within the door header. A centre-hung arm connects the operator to the door panel, while the bottom pivot supports the door's centre-hung movement. The operator spindle acts as the top pivot point.
   </p>
   <p class="copy">
    This arrangement differs from a surface-mounted swing door operator and from the Centre Spindle configuration. The centre-hung door pivots about its own centre line, making the correct arm, pivot, handing and door preparation details important during project planning.
